{
 "part": "script/script_0078",
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0C61",
   "src": "b77f8a1cbbed",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Vaya, también hay<NL>lugares así…<WAIT>…¿Se podrá esquiar?<WAIT><FACE:05>¡No digas tonterías!<NL>¡Qué frío hace!<WAIT>¡Tomemos este bloque<NL>de una vez!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0CC2",
   "src": "3aa9d09399a9",
   "t": "<FACE:80>¡Yaaaaah…!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0CCE",
   "src": "3bbbae0bce03",
   "t": "<FACE:80>¡Hoooooooo!!!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0CDE",
   "src": "b5668a5a96c2",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¿¡Qué!?<NL>¡Qué gritote fue ese!<WAIT><FACE:03>Parece que viene de<NL>los parlantes…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0D0A",
   "src": "f12d27770a43",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¿No será por allá?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0D18",
   "src": "ef2e98df7ee7",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>¿Tembló bastante-robo?<NL>¡Pero cerquita-robo!<WAIT>¡Faltó poquito-robo!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0D42",
   "src": "c511064fbd78",
   "t": "<FACE:7F>¡Ya se anima el gran<NL>grito Sperobo-robo!<WAIT>¡Falta poco para la<NL>avalancha-robo!<NL><WAIT>Si con la avalancha<NL>cerramos este bloque,<WAIT>¡<PLAYER> y su grupo<NL>no pasan de acá-robo!<WAIT>¡Y el jefe Nyuudou nos<NL>dará un premio-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0DD9",
   "src": "0a8dc6cb232e",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¡¿Una avalancha?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0DE9",
   "src": "7e9c10ce3551",
   "t": "<FACE:04>Cierto, si la nieve<NL>nos tapa, no pasamos"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0E12",
   "src": "4f93cab8edcc",
   "t": "<FACE:04>Hay que hacer algo…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0E1F",
   "src": "9991dc74b57b",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¡Son los parlantes!<NL>Si los desconectamos…<WAIT><FACE:09>¿Alguna buena idea…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0E59",
   "src": "649cfabb75b4",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Búscale una solución<NL>de una vez!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0E76",
   "src": "71de3013eb75",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Es mi primera vez en<NL>una montaña nevada…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0E8A",
   "src": "921171a708fc",
   "t": "<FACE:19>¡Yo soy bueno para el<NL>esquí! ¿Les enseño?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0EAF",
   "src": "5fc736bab647",
   "t": "<FACE:15>¡Qué dices!<NL>¡Yo soy mejor que tú!<WAIT><FACE:14>¡Yo le enseño, líder!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0EDC",
   "src": "fb62f9d3d8f7",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¡Es esto!<NL><WAIT>Esto es lo que mueve<NL>esas bocinas…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0EF8",
   "src": "16b7f6e54317",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Vaya, es verdad…<NL><WAIT>¡Este es el cable de<NL>esa bocina!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0F19",
   "src": "7c8ce4242b6b",
   "t": "<FACE:19>Entonces lo cortamos,<NL>¿no-robo?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0F32",
   "src": "08e63c4095a8",
   "t": "<FACE:14>¡Eso! ¡Si lo cortas<NL>se acaba el ruido!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0F52",
   "src": "b574bf16e9f9",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Córtalo ya con tu<NL>Medabot, <PLAYER>!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0F6F",
   "src": "74ebf94f40dd",
   "t": "<FACE:80>Yujuuu (crac)…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0F7D",
   "src": "401671ef566e",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>¿Eh… la bocina se<NL>paró-robo? ¿Qué<WAIT>pasó-robo?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0FA0",
   "src": "abcb1c9b5fdf",
   "t": "<FACE:7E>¡Son ellos-robo!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0FAB",
   "src": "d13e4188f32d",
   "t": "<FACE:7E>¡Cortaron el cable<NL>-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0FC2",
   "src": "b970b7d6105f",
   "t": "<FACE:02>¡Lo logramos!<NL>¡Se cortó el sonido!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0FDB",
   "src": "ad51ac2b1405",
   "t": "<FACE:02>Una preocupación<NL>menos…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:0FEA",
   "src": "2f297e1f6bdc",
   "t": "<FACE:08>Oye, esos de allá<NL>están armando<WAIT>escándalo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:1007",
   "src": "671e1a760d25",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Parece que nos vieron<WAIT><FACE:19>¡Se ven muy enojados<NL>-robo!<WAIT><FACE:14>¡Vienen para acá!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:103E",
   "src": "d2e03bdbd63e",
   "t": "<FACE:01>¡Pelear de frente es<NL>mala idea!<WAIT>¡Escondámonos y nos<NL>reorganizamos!<WAIT>Quiero armar un<NL>Medabot que sirva en<WAIT>este campo…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:108C",
   "src": "48f050cdf88f",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¿¡De qué hablas!?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:1098",
   "src": "c3c6755278e6",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¿¡Eh!?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:109E",
   "src": "e6660a1da8d2",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Llevo rato diciendo<NL>que tengo frío!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:10BA",
   "src": "4560b2ed0c69",
   "t": "<FACE:04>Eh, bueno…<WAIT><FACE:06>¡Acaba con ellos y<NL>toma el bloque!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:10E3",
   "src": "74042672bd66",
   "t": "<FACE:7E>¡Oigan! ¡Ustedes!<NL>¡Vaya travesura-robo!<WAIT>¡Ahora les vamos a dar<NL>una lecc…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:1112",
   "src": "829f328e31e5",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Robobatalla, ya!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:1121",
   "src": "2a8ecc82a8c7",
   "t": "<FACE:81>…¿¡Eh!?… ¡sí-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:1131",
   "src": "f6efbfb627da",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Sí, sí, perdieron!<NL><WAIT>¡Ahora largo de aquí,<NL>todos ustedes!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:1157",
   "src": "f2516db09892",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¡Brrr, qué frío!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:1160",
   "src": "9d1c79ebc357",
   "t": "<FACE:7E>¡Tontooos-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:1170",
   "src": "a2fb37753f14",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¡Cuidado! ¡Ese temblor<NL>fue más fuerte!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:118B",
   "src": "c5e5e1819268",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¡Va a haber una<NL>avalancha! ¡<PLAYER>!<WAIT><FACE:05>¡Toma el control de<NL>este bloque, rápido!<WAIT><FACE:03>¡Qué! Pero…<WAIT><FACE:05>¡¿Qué estás diciendo?!<NL><WAIT>¡Si no te apuras no<NL>vamos a poder seguir!<WAIT><FACE:04>No… es que…<NL><WAIT>la avalancha nos…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:120F",
   "src": "57928b2c386e",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Anda ya!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:121E",
   "src": "3505e750d6b0",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Uf…<NL>Llegué de milagro…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:1233",
   "src": "af528af3872b",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¡<PLAYER>!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:123C",
   "src": "623b0a8ff7f2",
   "t": "<FACE:0D>Claro…<NL><WAIT>tampoco iban a recrear<NL>la avalancha…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:125C",
   "src": "b15e7648d2a4",
   "t": "<FACE:05>…Menos mal"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:1269",
   "src": "5ec8e6fce898",
   "t": "<FACE:01>¡Hay que apagar esos<NL>altavoces ya!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:1280",
   "src": "40edeee9748c",
   "t": "<FACE:04>¿Una maqueta…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0078:128A",
   "src": "961967045469",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Cuento contigo,<NL><MEDABOT>"
  }
 ]
}
